# Course source material: the lecture slides, the exam outline and the
# assignment PDFs that this quiz was built from.
#
# GitHub Pages serves the whole repo publicly, so anything committed here
# would be downloadable by anyone with the link -- including the assignment
# itself. Keeping it out of the repo avoids republishing the professor's and
# the publisher's material, and keeps the homework off a public URL.
#
# Delete this line if you'd rather version them (a private repo, say).
review/

